=== front matter ===
Eritrea
Population and 
Health Survey 2010


THE STATE OF ERITREA
Eritrea 
Population and 
Health Survey 
2010
National Statistics Office 
Asmara, Eritrea
Fafo Institute For Applied International Studies 
Oslo, Norway
August, 2013

This report summarizes the findings of the 2010 Eritrea Population and Health Survey (EPHS) carried out 
by the National Statistics Office. Financial support for the survey was provided by the Norwegian Ministry 
of Foreign Affairs (through NORAD), UNICEF, UNFPA, UNDP, WHO and the Ministry of Health. Fafo 
AIS and Kenya Medical Research Institute provided technical assistance for the survey. The opinions 
expressed herein are those of the authors and do not necessarily reflect the views of the funders.
Additional information about the EPHS may be obtained from the National Statistics Office P.O. Box 5838, 
Asmara, Eritrea (telephone: 291-1128034/7153234; e-mail:ainom.berhane@nso.gov.er).
 
 
Suggested citation:
National Statistics Office (NSO) [Eritrea] and Fafo AIS. 2013. Eritrea Population and Health Survey 2010. 
Asmara, Eritrea: National Statistics Office and Fafo Institute for Appled  International Studies.
